@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
' or:
scale 2
' or:
scale max 2000 width
title Accounting creates a % promotion and links it to shops/services

|Accountant|
start
:Select "Promotion Management";
:Select "Create % Promotion";
:Display promotion form;

|Accountant|
:Enter details:\n- Campaign name\n- Discount %\n- Effective period\n- Conditions (optional)\n- Limits (optional);
:Select applicable shop(s);\nSelect applicable category/service(s);
:Click "Save";

|Internal Wallet System|
:Validate data;\nCheck permission to create promotions;
if (Valid?) then (Yes)
  :Create Promotion;\nCreate Promotion-Shop-Service mappings;
  :Write audit log;
  :Return success result;
else (No)
  :Return error (duplicate name/time window /\ninvalid discount % / shop not found...);
endif

:Display result;
|Accounting/Finance|
stop
@enduml
